>>
endobj
173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (CHAPTER 9:  PERSEVERING WITH THE SPIRIT OF MIGHT)
/E (CHAPTER 9:  PERSEVERING WITH THE SPIRIT OF MIGHT)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The spirit of might allows us to persevere beyond our physical limitations. When Peter toiled all night and caught nothing, he still obeyed Jesus' command to try again. The spirit of might gives us the ability to keep going when we're tired. Jesus promises to give us rest, not just sleep, but the faith to trust in His ability.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
