/E (CHAPTER 11:  EMBRACING YOUR SPIRITUAL IDENTITY)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (God told Dr. Winston to buy a shopping mall despite having no resources or experience. By seeing himself as God saw him and standing on God's promises, Dr. Winston was able to possess the mall. The same anointing and revelation that God gave Dr. Winston is available to us through partnership.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
