188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (When God calls you to do something, your response should be "Okay." This simple act of obedience unlocks the door to God's supernatural provision. My husband and I experienced this when we were called to start business schools worldwide. By saying "yes," God provided everything we needed, even in unexpected ways.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
