191 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (God's system for creating wealth differs from the world's system. When we are good stewards of what God provides, He multiplies it. By following His instructions, we can see miraculous financial growth. God's strategies for wealth include tithing, saving, and sowing seeds, which He uses to bless us abundantly.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
